   {
    "tone": "warn",
    "text": "Cash does not go short in the nine week window. Low point is <strong>$136,593 the week of 9/25</strong>. Weeks two and three of each month carry the load: mortgage interest lands then, and the distribution out of Group Group falls in week three. Week one is the strongest week of every month and week three the weakest."
   },
   {
