    "text": "Weekly timing is derived from eight weeks of actual cash flow, June 7 through August 1, rather than dividing the month evenly. Income runs 42 percent in week one, 30 in week two, 5 in week three and 23 in week four. Levels come from the Fiscal Year Budget. Opening cash is the true bank balance of $319,102; uncleared transactions are not deducted because those bills flow through the forecast weeks as they clear."
